<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">- Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa jhukutumbula jha Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa jhukutumbula jha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohane</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa jha kutumbula jha Yohane ikajhandikwe na ntenga Yohane pange muchaka cha makome nhwano ade makome ticha pabhelwika Yecho Kilichitu. Yohane akilongolelajhe jwenio kubhehe ndi jwajhandike, nambo mu chula jha kutumbula innangiha kubhehe jwenio ndi jwalongela alolite kwa miho ghake pannema pano na tukamwene bada payokita Yecho, mu chula jha 1:1-3. Yene majhandikilo ghajhandike uhwanana hake na ngita hela chijhandikwe mu Lilobhe lya Mbone lya Yohane. Inhobheleka kubhehe Yohane akajhandike chimo cha itabo ncheche ya Lilobhe lya Mbone jha Yecho Kilichitu, pamonga na baluwa itato, yane baluwa jha kutumbula na jha ubhele na jha utato jha Yohane pakibha atamita ku muche gwa ku Epecho.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohane akajhandike baluwa jhenje kwa lilongo lya bhando bhubhanyeketii Kilichitu bhoha kipinde chenie bhando bhubhanyeketii Kilichitu bhakibha mukulagha hake na lilongo lya bhando lilikemitwa, “Akaginochitiki”. Bhamba bhakajheketii kubhehe Yecho akibha Chapanga kamile, nambo akibha jhe mundo jwa uchakaka jhuna hyegha na myae ngita chabhii mundo jwa pannema. Nhwalo gwenio Yohane akajhandike kubhehe jwalongila panane jha Yecho kutama kwake pannema na mabhoko ghake ghakampapihe Yecho, mu chula jha 1:1-3. Chikinkangita Yohane kujhandika baluwa jhenje ndi kulangiha luhangano lwake jwenio, mu chula jha 1:4, kwakanikiya bhubhanyeketii Kilichitu bhakoto kuhenga malemo, mu chula jha 2:1 na kwalonda na mabholo ghuwange, mu chula jha 2:26 na kwalobholela uchakaka bhando bhibhannyeketi Kilichitu kubhehe bhaghombolilwe, mu chula jha 5:13.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Yohane achimulila nhwalo gwa kujhandika baluwa jhake na nhwalo gwa kujhandika baluwa jhenje, mu chula jha 1:1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Na jwenio ilonge kubhehe Chapanga ndi lumule na tipalwa kutama ngita Yecho chatamita, mu chula jha 1:5-3:10.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhele atukombocha twenga unhwilo gwa kupalana, mu chula jha 3:11-5:12.</para>
  <para style="io">Peniya ijhomolela baluwa jhake, mu chula jha 5:13-21.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1" />
  <para style="s">Lilobhe lyapela bhando ughome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1" />Tunyandikii mangota Lilobhe lende lya ughome lilikibha kuhumii pukutumbuu. Tukalijhohine na kummona kwa miho ghito tabhete, tukalilolokiye na kulikamuu kwa mabhoko ghito tabhete. <verse eid="1JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2" />Ughome gwenio piupitila twenga tukauhwene na ngohe tutangacha malobhe ghake gha ughome gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta ghuukibha kwa Tate na kulangiwa kwito. <verse eid="1JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3" />Chitukiwene na kujhoha ndi chitutangachi na mangota hele, kupala na mangota mme pamonga na twenga mu kulombana na Tate na Mwana gwake Yecho Kilichitu. <verse eid="1JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4" />Tunnyandikila mangota malobhe ghanga luhangano lwito lutimile.<verse eid="1JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga ndi Lumule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5" />Lilobhe lende tulijhohine kubhoke kwa Yecho na ngohe tuntangacha kwino mangota kubhehe Chapanga ndi lumule na lubhii jhe lubhendo loloha nkate jhake. <verse eid="1JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6" />Anda tulongii kubhehe tubhii pamonga na jwenie, na papa peniya tutama mulubhendo, tulongele uwange na itendwa na malobhe ghito gha chakaka jhe. <verse eid="1JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7" />Nambo anda tutamite mulumule, ngita jweno chabhii mulumule, peniya tubhii maghumba nde twe kwa twenga na miyahe jha Yecho Kilichitu, Mwana gwa Chapanga itujhelebhuya uhakaho gwito ghoha.<verse eid="1JN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8" />Anda tulongii tukwetijhe uhakaho, tukikoloya tabhete, uchakaka ubhiijhe nkate jhito. <verse eid="1JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9" />Nambo anda tulongile kwa Chapanga tutei uhakaho, peniya Chapanga jwenio ndi jwahobholeka na jwaumbone, natulekekeya uhakaho gwito na kutujhelebhuha kubhoka mu gwanganandela gwoha ghututeile. <verse eid="1JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10" />Anda tulongii tutehijhe uhakaho, natuntenda Chapanga nhwange na lilobhe lyake libhijhe nkate jhito.<verse eid="1JN 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2" />
  <para style="s">Kilichitu ndi utangatilo gwito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1" />Yana yango iniipala, ninyandikila ilebhe henge, nkoto kuhenga uhakaho. Nambo anda apiti mundo jwatehi uhakaho, tukwete jhumo jwatutangati kutujhope kwa Tate, ndi Yecho Kilichitu jwangalilemwa. <verse eid="1JN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2" />Kilichitu ndi litambiko lilitubhokeya uhakaho gwito, hilu chi uhakaho gwito tugha, nambo uhakaho gwa nnema gwoha.<verse eid="1JN 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3" />Anda kuijhokanikiya mihilo jha Chapanga, peniya chakaka kubhehe tummanya. <verse eid="1JN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4" />Mundo akoto kulonge anda ammanya Chapanga, nambo ajhokanikii jhe mihilo jhake, bhahe, umanya mundo jwenio alonge uwange na uchakaka ubhii jhe nkate jhake. <verse eid="1JN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5" />Nhwalo mundo jhojhoha jwakamuu Lilobhe lya Chapanga, jwenio ndi jwakwete upalo ghutimile gwa Chapanga nkate jhake. Kilebhe chenie ndi tuhoto kumanya kubhehe tulombine na Chapanga. <verse eid="1JN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6" />Mundo jhojhoha jwailongela alombine na Chapanga, ipalwa kutama ngita Yecho Kilichitu chatamita.<verse eid="1JN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilaghilo liyono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7" />Akakoche bhunimpahile, lilaghilo lende lininyandikila leno chi lilaghilo liyono, nambo lende lilaghilo ndi limikibhanalo kubhoke pukutumbula. Lilaghilo lyenio ndi makacho ndi lela lilobhe linyohine. <verse eid="1JN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8" />Nambo kipinde chenje, lilaghilo lende lininnyandikila leno ndi lilaghilo liyono, uchakaka gwake ubhonekine nkate jha Kilichitu na nkate jhino hele. Nhwalo lubhendo lubhoka na lumule lutumbwii kumulikila.<verse eid="1JN 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9" />Mundo jhojhoha jwalonge atama mulumule, nambo inchimwa unung'una mundo, mundo jwenio amela mulubhendo. <verse eid="1JN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10" />Mundo jhojhoha jwampala unung'una mundo abhii mulumule lwenio, kibhii jhe kilebhe chochoha chela nkate jhake chikihoto kuntenda mundo jhonge ahenge uhakaho. <verse eid="1JN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11" />Nambo mundo jwanchimwa unung'una mundo abhii mulubhendo, ityanga mulubhendo na amanyii jhe kwaijhenda, nhwalo lubhendo luntehi abhehe jwangalola.<verse eid="1JN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12" />Ninyandikila mangota akayana nhwalo uhakaho gwino ulekekiwe kupete liina lya Kilichitu. <verse eid="1JN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13" />Ninyandikila mangota akatate nhwalo mummanye jwenio jwakibha kubhoke pakutumbuu. Ninyandikii mangota achikangombo nhwalo munhotwi Jwanganandela.<verse eid="1JN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14" />Ninyandikile mangota akayana nhwalo mu mmanye Tate. Ninyandikile mangota akatate nhwalo mu mmanye jwenio jwakibha kuhumii pakutumbula. Ninyandikile mangota achikangombo nhwalo nkwete makakala, na lilobhe lya Chapanga libhii nkate jhino na munhotwi Jwanganandela.<verse eid="1JN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15" />Mangaupala jhe nnema, hilu mambu ghighabhii mu nnema. Mundo jhojhoha jwaupala nnema, upalo gwa Tate ubhiijhe nkate jhake. <verse eid="1JN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16" />Nhwalo kila kilebhe chikibhii pannema, ngita tama mbajha ya yegha na ilebhe ibhaibhona bhando na kunoghelwa na kuloka kwa nhwalo jha ulohe, yenie yoha ibhokajhe kwa Tate, nambo ibhoke pannema. <verse eid="1JN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17" />Nnema pamonga na ilebhe yake yoha inoghela itenda kupeta, nambo mundo jwahenga ghapala Chapanga, atama machiko ghoha ghangapeta.<verse eid="1JN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likoko lya Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18" />Makayana, kupehekela kubhandikile! Mukajhohine kubhehe jwankana Kilichitu ahika, nambo ngohe akamakoko twe bha Kilichitu bhapitile, kwa gheniya tumanye kubhehe kipinde cha kupekehekeya kubhandikile. <verse eid="1JN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19" />Bhando bheniya bhahumii pakate jhito, nambo bhakibha bhito jhe ndi mana bhakatulekite, anda ngabhabhe bhito, ngabhatamite na twenga. Nambo ngabhatulekita, ngabhajhenda kupala kulangii bhakibha bhito jhe.<verse eid="1JN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20" />Nambo mangota mpakitwe mahuta na Uhuke gwa Chapanga kubhoka kwa Jhola Jwanyahinyahi, yenio umanye uchakaka. <verse eid="1JN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21" />Ninyandikila mangota, chi nhwalo ummanye jhe uchakaka, nambo umanye, kabhele ubhii ng'o uwange ghoghoha ghupatikana uchakaka.<verse eid="1JN 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22" />Bho, ghane ndi nhwange? Ndi jhola jwakana kubhehe Yecho chi Kilichitu Nkomboche jwahaghulilwe na Chapanga. Mundo ngita jwenio ndi Likoko nkolongwa jwa Kilichitu, jwenio ndi jwankana Tate na Mwana. <verse eid="1JN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23" />Nhwalo mundo jhojhoha jwankana Mwana, helahela ankana Tate, na mundo jhojhoha jwaumanya Mwana imanya na Tate hele.<verse eid="1JN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24" />Yene, lilobhe lyango limilijhohohine kuhumii makacho litame kumwojho gwino, anda lilobhe lyenio litamite nkate jhino, na mangota natama nkate jha Mwana na Tate. <verse eid="1JN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25" />Na lilaghano lela lyatulaghila Kilichitu jwenio ndi lende. Kutupe ghome machiko ghoha ghangapeta.<verse eid="1JN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26" />Ninnyandikila ilebhe henge kwa nhwalo gwa bhando bhala bhibhapata kunhobhecha mangota. <verse eid="1JN 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27" />Na mangota mpakwite mahuta na Uhuke jwa Chapanga kubhoke kwa Kilichitu. Na anda Uhuke atamite nkate jhino, mipalwa jhe kubholwa kabhele na mundo jhojhoha jhola. Nhwalo Uhuke jwenio amolangana kila kilebhe, na mabholo ghake ndi gha uchakaka na chi ghauwange. Bhahe, mughakamulile mabholo gha Uhuke na kujhendele kutama mu kulombana na Kilichitu.<verse eid="1JN 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28" />Chakaka, na ngohe akayana ntamengane nkate jhake, kupala kipinde papakuyekulilwa mma nganganga na nkoto kubhehe na hone palonge jhake pala pahika. <verse eid="1JN 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29" />Anda umanye kubhehe Kilichitu ihenga ghapala Chapanga, na kwa gheniya mipalwa kumanya kubhehe kila mundo jwahenga ghapala Chapanga ndi mwana jwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1JN 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yana ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1" />Nwachilangane ubhii bhole upalo ghongo gwa Tate chatupaii hake ade tukemwe yana ya Chapanga! Na chakaka ndi chitubhile. Yene bhando bha pannema bhatumanyajhe, nhwalo bhaumanyajhe Chapanga. <verse eid="1JN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2" />Akakoche bhango bhinimpahile, twenga ngohe ndi yana ya Chapanga, nambo ibhonikinejhe hotu chitupala kubhehe. Nambo tumanya kubhehe papakupitii Kilichitu, natuwanana na jwenio nhwalo natupabhona pabhile. <verse eid="1JN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3" />Yene, kila mundo jwabhii na lihobholelo lende mu Kilichitu, akijhelebhula jwenio ngita Kilichitu chajhelehwike.<verse eid="1JN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4" />Kila mundo jwahenga uhakaho ikana kutenda ngita lilaghalikilo lya Chapanga chilipala, nhwalo kuhenga uhakaho ndi kulikana lilaghalikilo lyenio. <verse eid="1JN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5" />Nhwalo umanye ngita Yecho Kilichitu akahikite kubhoha uhakaho gwito, na nkate jwa jwenio ubhiijhe uhakaho gwogwoha. <verse eid="1JN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6" />Yene, kila mundo jwatama kwa kulombana na Kilichitu ihenga ndeka uhakaho, nambo kila mundo jwahenga uhakaho amwejhe Kilichitu hilu kuumanya.<verse eid="1JN 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7" />Akayanango mangalogwa mundo jhojhoha ankolohe. Mundo jwahenga itendwa yaipala Chapanga jwenio ndi ijheketelwa na Chapanga ngita Kilichitu chainhalalicha Chapanga. <verse eid="1JN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8" />Nambo mundo jwahenga uhakaho jwenio ndi jwa Limbembela, nhwalo Limbembela atehi uhakaho kuhumii pukutumbula. Nambo Mwana gwa Chapanga ajhakuhika pannema kuhangabhana lihengo lya Limbembela.<verse eid="1JN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9" />Kila mundo jwabhelwikwe na Chapanga ihengajhe uhakaho, nhwalo ughome uhyono gwapatite na Chapanga ubhii nkate jhake. Na kabhele ihotojhe kuhenga uhakaho nhwalo jwenio ndi mwana jwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1JN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10" />Pamba ndi pupalangiya yana ya Chapanga na yana ya Limbembela. Nhwalo mundo jhojhoha jwangahenga ilebhe yukunhalalii Chapanga amu yangaipala unung'una mundo jwenio chi mwana jwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1JN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tupalane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11" />Nhwalo lende ndi lilobhe linyohina kuhumii makacho ndi lende, kubhehe tupalane twabhete kwa twabhete! <verse eid="1JN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12" />Tukoto kubhehe ngita Kaine, jwalongwichwa na Limbembela, ngankomita unung'una mundo. Na akankomite kwa nhwalo ghane? Akankomite kwa nhwalo itendwa yakwe yakabhii nayo yanganandela, nhwalo itendwa ya unung'una mundo ikajheketilwe palonge jha Chapanga!<verse eid="1JN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13" />Yene, akalongo bhango, nkoto kukangacha ngita bhando bha pannema bhanchimwe mangota. <verse eid="1JN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14" />Twenga tumanye kubhehe tupokonywike kuhumii mukuwegha na kujhingii mughome nhwalo jwapala akalongo bhito bhibhanyeketi Kilichitu. Mundo jwangabhehe na upalo ijhendelela kutama mukuwe. <verse eid="1JN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15" />Kila mundo jwanchimwa unung'una mundo jwenio ndi nkomi, mangota umanye kubhehe mundo jhojhoha nkomi akwetijhe ughome gwa machiko ghoha gwangapeta ghutama nkate jhake. <verse eid="1JN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16" />Twenga tumanye kupalana ndi kilebhe ghane, nhwalo Kilichitu akabhohite ughome gwake kwa nhwalo gwito. Na twenga helahela tupalwa kubhoha ughome gwito kwa nhwalo gwa akalongo bhito bhibhanyeketii Kilichitu. <verse eid="1JN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17" />Yene, mundo anda akwete ilebhe ya pamba pannema, peniya amwene nnongo mundo alolite, nambo apahijhe kunkole kiya, nahotola bho, kulonge ampala Chapanga? <verse eid="1JN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18" />Yana yango bhunimpahile, upalo gwino ukoto kubhehe malobhe ndo, nambo kupalana kwino kubhonekane kwa itendwa na uchakaka.<verse eid="1JN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihobholelo kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19" />Yene, ndi tuhoto kumanye kubhehe twe ndi bhando bha uchakaka, na miojho jhito naibhejhe na kiholo palonge jha Chapanga. <verse eid="1JN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20" />Ata ipitile kubhehe uhotolo gwito gwa kumanya tutei ghambone amu kulemwa ituhadabuu kubhehe tutei uhakaho, tumanye kubhehe Chapanga ndi nkolongwa kuliku uhotolo gwenio na jwenio amanye kila kilebhe. <verse eid="1JN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21" />Akakoche bhango, anda uhotolo gwito gwa kumanya ghamaha na ghanganandela anda utuhadabwilejhe natubhehejhe na kiholo palonge jha Chapanga, <verse eid="1JN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22" />na twenga tupoke kila kilebhe chitujhopa kubhoke kwa jwenio, nhwalo tujheketela lilaghilo lyake na kuhenga ghala ghaghapala. <verse eid="1JN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23" />Na lilaghilo lyake ndi lende. Kunnyekete Mwana gwake Yecho Kilichitu, na kupalana ngita twe Kilichitu chatupahile. <verse eid="1JN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24" />Jwajhekete lilaghilo lya Chapanga atama nkate jha Chapanga na Chapanga atama nkate jha jweno. Kwa ndela ya Uhuke gwa Chapanga jwatupeile Chapanga, twenga tumanye kubhehe Chapanga atama mu kulombana na twenga.<verse eid="1JN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4" />
  <para style="s">Kuimanya ihuke ya uchakaka na jhuwange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1" />Akakoche bhango bhunimpahile, nkoto kunyekete kila mundo akwete kihuke cha Chapanga, nambo munyighe mundo jwenio pange abhii na Kihuke jwa Chapanga, nhwalo bhalondole bhamahele bha uwange bhapiti pamba pannema. <verse eid="1JN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2" />Jenje ndi naumanya anda mundo alongochwa na Uhuke gwa Chapanga. Kila mundo jwajheketela kubhehe Yecho Kilichitu akahikite, akibha mundo, mundo jwenio akwete Uhuke gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1JN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3" />Nambo mundo jhojhoha jwangannyekete Yecho Kilichitu, akwetejhe Uhuke jwahuma kwa Chapanga. Mundo jwenio akwete Uhuke jwankana Kilichitu, na mangota nnyohine atenda kuhika, na ngohe ahikite pannema!<verse eid="1JN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4" />Nambo mangota yana ya Chapanga manhotwile milondole bha uwange bheniya, nhwalo Uhuke gwa Chapanga jwabhii nkate jhino jhuna makakala hake kupeta uhuke jwabhii nkate jha bhando bhubhabhii pannema. <verse eid="1JN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5" />Milondole bha uwange bhoha bhilonge ilebhe ya pannema na nnema gwajhokanikiya nhwalo bheniya ndi bha pannema. <verse eid="1JN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6" />Nambo twenga ndi bhando bha Chapanga. Mundo jwaumanye Chapanga atujhokonikiya, mundo jwangaumanya Chapanga atujhokonikijhe. Yene, tuhoto kumanya Uhuke ghane gwa chakaka gwa Chapanga na uhuke ghane gwa uwange.<verse eid="1JN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upalo gwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7" />Akakoche bhango bhinimpala, tupalane, nhwalo upalo uhuma kwa Chapanga. Kila mundo jwabhii na upalo ndi mwana gwa Chapanga na aumanye Chapanga. <verse eid="1JN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8" />Mundo jwangabhehe na upalo, aumanyejhe Chapanga, nhwalo Chapanga ndi upalo. <verse eid="1JN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9" />Na Chapanga akalangihe upalo gwake kwito, kwa kuntuma Mwana mundo jwakanjika pannema, kupala tubhehe na ughome kwa ndela jhake. <verse eid="1JN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10" />Upalo gwa uchakaka ndi ghongo. Chi twenga tukatumbwi kumpala Chapanga, nambo jwenio Chapanga akatupahi twenga na ata kuntuma Mwana gwake abhehe ndela jha kutujhelanicha kwa nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwito.<verse eid="1JN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11" />Akakoche bhango bhunimpahile, anda Chapanga akatupahi naha, na twenga tupalwa kupalana. <verse eid="1JN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12" />Abhii jhe mundo jwakawaite kummona Chapanga kipinde chochoha, nambo anda tupaline, Chapanga natama nkate jhito na upalo gwake ukamilika hake nkate jhito.<verse eid="1JN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13" />Kwa lilobhe lyenio tumanye kubhehe tutama nkate jhake na jwenio abhii nkate jhito, nhwalo jwenio atupekihe Uhuke gwake. <verse eid="1JN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14" />Na twenga tulolite na kwatangachii bhange kubhehe Tate antumite Mwana mundo abhehe Nkomboche jwa pannema. <verse eid="1JN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15" />Kila mundo jwatangacha kubhehe Yecho ndi Mwana gwa Chapanga, Chapanga itama nkate jhake na jwenio utama nkate jha Chapanga. <verse eid="1JN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16" />Bhahe, twenga tumanye na tujheketela upalo gwabhii nako Chapanga kwito twenga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1JN 4:16">Chapanga ndi upalo na jhojhoha jwatama muupalo na alombine na Chapanga na Chapanga alombine na jwenio. <verse eid="1JN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17" />Mu lende upalo gwa Chapanga ukamilichwe kwito tukoto kubhehe na kiholo mu lichiko lya luhadabulo. Ughome gwito pamba pannema ngita ghala gha Kilichitu. <verse eid="1JN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18" />Paubhii upalo ubhiijhe bhoghohe, hena upalo ghukamilike ubhenga bhoghohe ghoha, bhahe, mundo jwabhii na bhoghohe akamilikejhe muupalo, nhwalo kujhoghopa kulangii palonge pabhii luhadabulo.<verse eid="1JN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19" />Twenga tubhii na upalo, nhwalo Chapanga ndi jwakatumbwii kutupala. <verse eid="1JN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20" />Mundo anda alongii ampala Chapanga na kongo anchimwa nnongo mundo, jwenio ndi nhwange. Nhwalo mundo anda ampahijhe nnongo mundo jwammona, ihotojhe kumpala Chapanga jwangammona. <verse eid="1JN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21" />Yene, Kilichitu atupekihe unhwilo ghongo. Jwampala Chapanga ipalwa ampala jwanyeketii Kilichitu nnyake hele.<verse eid="1JN 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5" />
  <para style="s">Tuuhotwii nnema kwa kihobholelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1" />Kila mundo jwajhekete kubhehe Yecho ndi Kilichitu akatumitwe na Chapanga kung'ombola, jwenio ndi mwana gwa Chapanga. Na kila mundo jwampala tate ampala na mwana hele. <verse eid="1JN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2" />Yene ndi chitumanye kubhehe tuipala yana ya Chapanga, kwa kumpala Chapanga na kuikamu mihilo jhake. <verse eid="1JN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3" />Nhwalo kumpala Chapanga ndi kujhokanikiya mihilo jhake. Na nhwilo gwake unonopa jhe kuikengama, <verse eid="1JN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4" />nhwalo kila jwabhelwikwe na Chapanga auhotwi nnema. Kwa ndela jhene tuhotwile nnema, kwa kihobholelo chito. <verse eid="1JN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5" />Bho, ghane auhotola nnema? Ndi jhola jwajheketii kubhehe Yecho ndi Mwana gwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1JN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho Kilichitu ndi ghane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6" />Yecho Kilichitu ndi jwakahikite kwa mache na miyahe jha kuwe kwake. Akahikitijhe kwa mache tugha, nambo kwa mache na kwa miyahe jhake. Na Uhuke ndi jwatangacha malobhe ghanga kubhehe Uhuke ndi chakaka. <verse eid="1JN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7" />Bhahe, bhabhii bhatato bhubhitangacha. <verse eid="1JN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8" />Ndi Uhuke gwa Chapanga, mache na miyahe; kwa bhoha bhatato bhajheketelana. <verse eid="1JN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9" />Anda tujheketela chikilongelwa na bhando, bhahe chikilongelwa na Chapanga ndi kitopi hake nhwalo ghanga ndi malobhe ghalongila Chapanga kwa Mwana Mundo. <verse eid="1JN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10" />Jwannyekete Mwana gwa Chapanga abhii uwachakaka kumwojho gwake, nambo jwangannyekete Chapanga, intenda Chapanga kubhehe nhwange, nhwalo akajheketijhe malobhe ghapiita Chapanga kwa Mwana mundo. <verse eid="1JN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11" />Na malobhe gheniya ndi ghanga, Chapanga atupii ughome gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta, na ghome gwenio ubhii nkate jha Mwana. <verse eid="1JN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12" />Mundo jhojhoha jwabhinako Mwana gwa Chapanga abhii na ghome gweno, jwangabhehe na Mwana gwa Chapanga akwetijhe ghome.<verse eid="1JN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghome gwa machiko ghoha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13" />Ninnyandikila mangota ilebhe henge bhumunnyeketile liina lya Mwana gwa Chapanga, umanye kubhehe mmi na ughome gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="1JN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14" />Na twenga tubhii nganganga palonge jha Chapanga nhwalo tumanye uchakaka kubhehe pitunnyopa kilebhe chochoha ngita chaipala jwenio atujhokanikiya. <verse eid="1JN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15" />Jwenio atujhokonikiya kila pitunnyopa na nhwalo tumanye kubhehe jweno atujhokonikiya kila pitunnyopa, tumanye hele kubhehe atupe ghoha ghitunnyopa.<verse eid="1JN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16" />Mundo anda amwehi nnongo mundo atenda uhakaho lyangannete kuwegha, ipalwa kunyopee kwa Chapanga na Chapanga nampela ughome. Nilonge yenio kwa bhala bhubhatehi uhakaho gwangapaleke kuwe. Nambo ubhii uhakaho ghumpelekela mundo mu kuwegha, nanenga nilonge jhe kubhehe mipalwa kunnyopa Chapanga nhwalo gwa gheniya. <verse eid="1JN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17" />Kila kitendwa changanandela palonge jha Chapanga ndi uhakaho, nambo ubhii uhakaho gwangampeleke mundo mu kuwegha.<verse eid="1JN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18" />Tumanye kubhehe kila jwabhelwikwe na Chapanga ahenga jhe uhakaho, nhwalo jwenio ulondwa na Mwana jwa Chapanga, yenio Limbembela intendajhe kilebhe.<verse eid="1JN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19" />Tumanye twenga ndi yana ya Chapanga pamo nakubhehe nnema ghoha ulongochwa na Limbembela jwenio.<verse eid="1JN 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20" />Chakaka tumanye kubhehe Mwana gwa Chapanga ahikite, atupehile malango tumanye Chapanga jwa uchakaka, tutama kwa kulombana na Chapanga jwa uchakaka na kulombana na Mwana mundo, Yecho Kilichitu. Na jhonjo ndi Chapanga jwa uchakaka na ghongo ndi ghome gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta.<verse eid="1JN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21" />Yana yango mwibhambale kuijhinamii ichapanga yawange!<verse eid="1JN 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5" />
</usx>